ption><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 13:36:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>是啊，Active Armor，我觉得这事儿得算你这边的一次重大失败。收到了已拦截通知（两次），然后立马就接到了同一个号码打来的电话。</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa1ddc428dfe</link><description>&lt;p&gt;是啊，Active Armor，我觉得这事儿得算你这边的一次重大失败。收到了已拦截通知（两次），然后立马就接到了同一个号码打来的电话。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt='Phone notification of two items. First a missed call from a "local" number. Second, a notice from Active Armor that it blocked a spam call. From the same number.' height="617" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/swrogers/6aa1ddc428dfe.jpg" width="1439"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://swrogers.some.pics"&gt;@swrogers&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 22:29:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>😺 需要帮忙吗？</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa1c95e83ac8</link><description>&lt;p&gt;😺 需要帮忙吗？&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A close-up of a dark laptop keyboard with a cat’s paw resting across the right side, covering several keys (including the arrow keys). The laptop screen is on in the background with a blue‑purple glow." height="4012" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/atog/6aa1c95e83ac8.jpg" width="3004"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://atog.some.pics"&gt;@atog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 21:02:26 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>鳄鱼乱入抢镜</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa1c40c68656</link><description>&lt;p&gt;抢镜的鳄鱼&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="photobombing alligator" height="633" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hilary/6aa1c40c68656.jpg" width="796"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hilary.some.pics"&gt;@hilary&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 20:39:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>雨与温和，已然几分秋意</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa1bb9d8f021</link><description>&lt;p&gt;雨与温和，已然几分秋意&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Eine grosse, ganz klare und stille Pfütze in der die pastellfarbenden Abendwolken reflektiert werden und auf dessen Oberfläche gelbe Birkenblätter schwimmen. Eine einzelne Straßenlaterne wird noch im Wasser reflektiert 

A large, crystal-clear and still puddle in which the pastel-coloured evening clouds are reflected, and on the surface of which yellow birch leaves float. A single street lamp is still reflected in the water " height="2972" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6aa1bb9d8f021.jpg" width="2972"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 20:03:48 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>🐝</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa1aa11381a6</link><description>&lt;p&gt;🐝&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A sticker on a pole, with the letter &amp;quot;b&amp;quot;. There's also a smaller X, with two eyes drawn above it." height="4032" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/maique/6aa1aa11381a6.jpg" width="3024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://maique.some.pics"&gt;@maique&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 18:48:58 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>恼怒的玳瑁猫低头看</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa1a6f733840</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一张降低饱和度的玳瑁三花猫照片，只露出她的头部，她低头凝视，因被打扰而显得烦躁。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Desaturated photo of a tortico cat showing just her head as she gazes down, annoyed at the disturbance." height="1332" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hp/6aa1a6f733840.jpg" width="2000"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hp.some.pics"&gt;@hp&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 18:35:38 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>